<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "avemaria.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\山車道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>This is something I only heard about, though.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What the local police saw first was a <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ぼうぜん">dazed</STYLE>, slumped-down <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花倒れる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Beside her, collapsed on the asphalt, <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
An ambulance arrived along with the police, and my <STYLE ID="2">senpais</STYLE> were taken to a nearby hospital.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no one who looked like the culprit, and at the scene there were a car's skid marks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was conjectured that <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had probably been hit by the car the shinigami was riding in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet, skid marks.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院待合室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> wasn't injured, but <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was in a state where every second counted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Emergency surgery was performed, but the chances of saving her were low, I was told.<PG>
Having arrived at the hospital, I was waiting in the waiting area with <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> for the surgery to end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> didn't respond when I called to her, and just kept,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
murmuring it, as if delirious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> seen at the scene?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have seen the moment <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was hit, and the moment the culprit fled, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Because I said 'help me'... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If I hadn't told </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> 'protect me'―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mumbling to herself in a small voice, <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> had her gaze turned diagonally downward, staring somewhere with unfocused eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, it's all right. I'll be by your side the whole time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Y-yes! What is it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than 4 hours had passed since <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was found, and at last she looked my way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> seen? What did <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE> know?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, she... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">attacked."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"B-by who!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The shinigami."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Shi...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I feel like <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> said something like that on the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, it's obviously just <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="・・・">that person</STYLE> in disguise.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The shinigami, it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s dad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The answer that came back was different from my deduction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> lost her mind?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or was she saying just what she had seen?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't know what more I could say.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, sorry about this... Keeping you with us this late. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Apparently, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-san's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> will be here soon, from Motoki Police Station."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, just her?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Could you come over here for a moment?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe it was hard to talk in front of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That made sense. Because, <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'll be right back, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's all right, I'll be right where </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> can see me. That's okay, isn't it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah, we're only stepping away a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院待合室2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"As I thought... the culprit in this incident is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been thinking the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter what, I couldn't see <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> as anything but suspicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It contradicted what the only eyewitness, <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, had said, though...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"The thing is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Just now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s body was found... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Her house caught fire, and she was found as a burned body..."</STYLE><PG>
No way! Suicide, because she thought she was cornered...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, for a suicide over being the culprit, it's baffling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving aside <STYLE ID="3">her daughter, Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, she left <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> unharmed, and then suicide?<PG>
From fleeing the scene to killing herself, it would have been about 4 hours, I suppose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, timewise, it's entirely possible, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... that's strange, isn't it... Then what was the point of chasing my </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">senpais</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> around..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah. If it was suicide, the reason she'd die is a complete mystery..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE> is the culprit, her actions are far too inconsistent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is the culprit someone else... or was there a reason I can't understand...<PG>
So after all, the shinigami's true identity really is <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I don't believe that! It has to be a clever trick!<PG>
To begin with, considering <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s age and when <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father died, it wouldn't be strange if she didn't remember his face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s testimony can't be relied on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still, after all, decide that the culprit is <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE>.<PG>
A hypothesis, you decide on it and test it, and if there's a mistake, you just correct it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A dead person being the culprit, that just isn't possible.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Keep the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> culprit theory just between us. I'm going to go search </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s home. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, sorry, but... please stay with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Of course. I meant to from the start. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I straightened up, facing <STYLE ID="8">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Assistant Inspector Ise</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. Thank you, truly, for all your running around for the people who are precious to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bowed my head as low as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"No, it's wrong for you to thank me. I have to apologize. In the end, I was no help at all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">On top of letting the culprit get away, even </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> ended up like that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I'm truly sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="8">Ise-san</STYLE> left the hospital.<PG>
No, <STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE> truly did your best.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm grateful from the bottom of my heart.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE2" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, as if trading places with him, <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE> rushed in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is safe!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I called out to her, <STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE> stopped in her tracks and looked toward <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Haah... thank goodness...!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="9">Really, thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE> let out a cry of <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="あんど">relief</STYLE>.<PG>
But,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, how is she!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="10">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... what happened to her!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right away, the color drained from her face again, and she shouted at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt an indescribable wrongness in <STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE>'s attitude.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was only natural to worry about her longtime best friend, <STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE>, and her family, but...<PG>
And at that moment, a certain hypothesis took shape inside me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Truly without any grounds, a hypothesis.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Less a hypothesis than... 
{PAUSE ""}
a guess.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if that's how it is... should I say this...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stared straight into <STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE>'s eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">............!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could see <STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE>'s expression changing before my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Wh-what's wrong...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"You know, don't you? The reason something like this happened..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... that's..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, could it be that they..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When she heard me say that, <STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE> let out a big sigh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Just what I'd expect... from </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">To get this far with only this much information..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unfortunately, it seemed my hypothesis had been right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... even so, when I thought about <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth could I do...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"When I think about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... I can't tell you what to do, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
